<title>SPAIN: Spain's BBV lends Madrid region 7.5 bln ptas.</title>
<headline>Spain's BBV lends Madrid region 7.5 bln ptas.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish bank Banco Bilbao Vizcaya (BBV) said on Monday it had loaned the Madrid region 7.5 billion pesetas, payable in five years.</p>
<p>Last month, the bank also acted as guarantor for half the region's issue of 15 billion pesetas of 10-year 6.30 percent debt, BBV said.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
